{"sha": "86a245e4984351ba1caa178c19f34d16b0d11d67e064de0d43c998d608f1cadc", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:fluid-statics} 章 --- 流体静力学}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:fluid-statics:1}", "$P = P_0 + \\rho gh$: \\qty{2.0e5}{Pa} (\\qty{2.0}{bar}), \\qty{1.1e6}{Pa}", "（\\qty{11}{bar}），\\qty{1.0e7}{Pa}（\\qty{101}{bar}）。在 \\qty{300}{m} 深处：$P =", "\\qty{3.1e6}{Pa}$，作用在 \\qty{1}{m^2} 上的力为 \\qty{3.1}{MN}（净值，", "扣除内部 \\qty{1}{atm} 的反压后为 \\qty{3.0}{MN}）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:fluid-statics:2}", "$h = P/\\rho g$：汞柱 \\qty{0.760}{m}；水柱 \\qty{10.3}{m}。水泵", "至多能在水面上方造出真空，此时大气", "压将水柱托起 \\qty{10.3}{m}，不能再高。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:fluid-statics:3}", "$F_2 = F_1S_2/S_1 = \\qty{10}{kN}$（相当于一吨）；$d_2 = d_1S_1/S_2 = \\qty{2.0}{mm}$", "（排开的体积相同，做功相同）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:fluid-statics:4}", "两臂中油--水界面所在水平面处的压强相同：$\\rho_og", "h_o = \\rho_wgh_w$，$h_w = 0.85 \\times 12 = \\qty{10.2}{cm}$，即另一臂中该水平面以上", "的水柱高度；油面", "则高出 $12 - 10.2 = \\qty{1.8}{cm}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:fluid-statics:5}", "$H = RT/Mg = 8.314 \\times 273/(0.029 \\times 9.81) = \\qty{8.0}{km}$; $P/P_0 =", "\\eu^{-z/H}$：在 \\qty{5}{km} 处为 $0.54$，在 \\qty{8848}{m} 处为 $0.33$；压强减半的高度为 $H\\ln2 =", "\\qty{5.5}{km}$ --- 即在\\cref{ch:b1:kinetic-theory}中所用的数值。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:fluid-statics:6}", "$F = \\tfrac12\\rho gh^2L = \\qty{1.96e8}{N}$；压力中心位于 \\qty{13.3}{m}", "深处，即底部以上 \\qty{6.7}{m}；对底部的力矩为 $F \\times", "6.7 = \\qty{1.3e9}{N.m}$。将坝体朝水的一侧弯成拱形，使推力", "转化为拱的压缩，并传至山谷两侧。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:fluid-statics:7}", "$917/1025 = 89\\%$；原木 $60\\%$。筏子：完全浸没时的浮力 $1000 \\times", "2.0 \\times 9.81 = \\qty{19.6}{kN}$，自重 \\qty{11.8}{kN}，", "尚余 \\qty{7.8}{kN}，可载十人\\dots{}第十人脚湿：九人可保持干燥", "(\\qty{800}{kg}).", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:fluid-statics:8}", "浸没体积为 $m/\\rho$：水中 \\qty{20}{cm^3}；盐水中 $20/1.1 = \\qty{18.2}{cm^3}$，", "少 $\\qty{1.8}{cm^3}$，即杆身多出 $1.8/0.50 = \\qty{3.6}{cm}$，", "故露出 \\qty{7.6}{cm}。灵敏度 $\\approx m/(\\rho^2S) \\approx \\qty{40}{cm}$ 每单位", "相对密度（相对密度变化 $0.1$ 时约 \\qty{3.6}{cm}）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:fluid-statics:9}", "排开体积 $2800/1.025 = \\qty{2732}{m^3}$：\\qty{268}{m^3}（$9\\%$）露出", "水面。中性浮力时质量为 $1025 \\times 3000 = \\qty{3075}{t}$：需注入 \\qty{275}{t}。", "淡水中：浮力降至 \\qty{3000}{t}，超重 \\qty{75}{t} --- 将下沉，", "除非抽出 \\qty{75}{t}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:fluid-statics:10}", "排开空气：$10^{-2} \\times 1.20 = \\qty{12.0}{g}$；内部氦气 $12.0 \\times", "4/29 = \\qty{1.7}{g}$；橡胶 \\qty{3.0}{g}，净升力 \\qty{7.3}{g} --- 可承托七米", "长的轻绳。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:fluid-statics:11}", "力矩 $\\int_0^h\\rho gx\\cdot xL\\,\\dd x = \\rho gLh^3/3$，压力 $\\rho gLh^2/2$：", "力臂 $2h/3$。自 $h_1$ 至 $h_2$：力矩 $\\rho gL(h_2^3 - h_1^3)/3$，压力", "$\\rho gL(h_2^2 - h_1^2)/2$：深度 $\\frac23(h_2^3 - h_1^3)/(h_2^2 - h_1^2)$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:fluid-statics:12}", "多浸没 $x$ 时，附加浮力 $\\rho gSx$ 竖直向上：$m\\ddot x = -\\rho gSx$，", "$\\omega_0^2 = \\rho gS/m$, $T = 2\\pi\\sqrt{m/\\rho gS} = 2\\pi\\sqrt{0.020/(1000 \\times", "9.81 \\times 5\\times10^{-5})} = \\qty{1.3}{s}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:fluid-statics:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $P = 1.013\\times10^5 + 1025 \\times 9.81 \\times 300 = \\qty{3.12e6}{Pa}", "= \\qty{31}{bar}$.", "", "\\textbf{2.} $S = \\pi(0.40)^2 = \\qty{0.503}{m^2}$：合力 $(P - P_0)S =", "\\qty{1.52e6}{N}$ --- 相当于 155 吨，即一辆满载卡车压在舱盖上。", "", "\\textbf{3.} 龙骨再深 \\qty{10}{m}：压强增加 $+\\rho g \\times 10 = \\qty{1.0e5}{Pa}$，", "约 $3\\%$：船体受载近似均匀。", "", "\\textbf{4.} $\\Delta\\rho/\\rho = \\chi_T\\Delta P = 4.6\\times10^{-10} \\times 3.0\\times10^6", "= 0.14\\%$：对压强可忽略（仅几千帕，占", "三百万帕中的一部分）。", "", "\\textbf{5.} 外部三十巴，内部一巴：船体是一种承受向内压力的压力容器，", "圆柱（或球面）壳能把压力转化为", "沿壁的压缩，钢材对此抵抗力强，而平板", "则会弯曲。", "", "\\textbf{6.} $\\Delta P\\,R/e = 3.0\\times10^6 \\times 5.0/0.030 = \\qty{5.0e8}{Pa}", "= \\qty{500}{MPa}$：接近屈服应力 --- \\qty{300}{m} 已接近", "此船体的极限，更深的船需要更厚或更强的钢材", "（或钛）。", "", "\\textbf{7.} 排开体积 $m_0/\\rho = 2800/1.025 = \\qty{2732}{m^3}$：\\qty{268}{m^3}", "露出水面（$9\\%$）。", "", "\\textbf{8.} 中性浮力：$m = \\rho V = \\qty{3075}{t}$：注入 \\qty{275}{t}。", "", "\\textbf{9.} 浮力减少 $0.1\\%$ 的 $\\rho Vg$：$0.001 \\times 3075 \\times 9.81", "\\times10^3 = \\qty{30}{kN}$，方向向下（相当于三吨）。更深 $\\Rightarrow$ 压缩增加", "$\\Rightarrow$ 变重：不稳定 --- 潜艇必须持续调整配平", "（钢质艇体的压缩比水小，这有所帮助；", "艇体过于柔软则会沉没而无法回升）。", ""]}